TITLE 1D transport 10 cells 10 shifts; exchange
SOLUTION 0  Initial solution
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 11 Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -time_step 1
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -initial_time 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected_output_1.sel
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell viscosity_mPas
10 PUNCH SIM_NO, CELL_NO, RHO
END
